  "question": "Is MISSED_TRADER_ENTRY = 0 real, or an artifact of the regrade reporting only the FIRST decision through window end? If the bot fired early and that early entry was what got reported, a later candidate matching the trader would be invisible and the zero would be a reporting property, not a kernel property.",
